{com}. 
. * Calculate CEM-weighted post-matching statistics by group.
. use `postfile', clear
{txt}
{com}. 
. tempname posth
{txt}
{com}. tempfile posttmp
{txt}
{com}. postfile `posth' str80 Variable str10 Group ///
>     double post_mean post_se post_ll post_ul ///
>     using `posttmp', replace
